---
// A visual explanation of the workflow, not an interactive editor or screenshot.
---

<div class="relative">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="overflow-hidden rounded-panel border border-section-line bg-section-panel text-left shadow-panel">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-section-line bg-ui-fill/60 px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <div class="hidden gap-1.5 sm:flex"><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-brand-muted/50"></span><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-brand-muted/30"></span><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-brand-muted/30"></span></div>
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-foreground">Your site <span class="mx-1 text-brand-muted">/</span> Workspace</span>
      </div>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-brand-muted"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>All changes saved</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:min-h-[28rem] md:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr_1fr]">
      <div class="hidden border-r border-section-line bg-material p-3 md:block">
        <p class="px-3 pb-3 pt-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-brand-muted">PROJECT</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-ui-fill px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-brand-foreground"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent"></span>Content</div>
        <p class="px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-brand-muted">Agent</p>
        <p class="px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-brand-muted">Preview</p>
        <p class="px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-brand-muted">History</p>
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 border-b border-section-line p-6 sm:p-8 md:border-b-0 md:border-r">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-brand-muted"><span>Blog / New chapter</span><span class="rounded-md bg-ui-fill/70 px-2 py-1">Markdown</span></div>
        <p class="mt-8 text-xs font-medium text-brand-muted">TITLE</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-brand-foreground">A new chapter<br />for your site.</p>
        <div class="my-6 h-px bg-ui-fill"></div>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-muted">BODY</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-copy">Good ideas deserve a site that keeps up. Make the update, see the result, and keep moving.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex gap-2"><span class="h-1.5 w-3/4 rounded-full bg-ui-fill"></span><span class="h-1.5 w-8 rounded-full bg-ui-fill/70"></span></div>
        <p class="mt-8 truncate font-mono text-[0.6875rem] text-brand-muted">src/content/blog/en/launch.md</p>
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 bg-material p-5 sm:p-6">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted"><span>Live preview</span><span class="text-brand-accent">Connected</span></div>
        <div class="flex min-h-72 flex-col rounded-xl bg-neutral-100 p-6 text-neutral-900 sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-200 pb-4"><span class="text-xs font-semibold">Your site.</span><span class="h-1 w-8 rounded-full bg-neutral-300"></span></div>
          <p class="mt-7 text-[0.625rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-action-edge">What's new</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight">A new chapter<br />for your site.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">Good ideas deserve a site that keeps up.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 h-7 w-24 rounded-lg bg-action-bottom shadow-[0_2px_0_var(--color-action-edge)]"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] leading-relaxed text-brand-muted sm:text-xs">Workflow illustration · Your Markdown on one side. Your site on the other.</p>
</div>
